{"language_code":"msa","language_probability":1.0,"text":"Tiada satu unit pun mampu melakukannya sendirian. Cawangan Penguatkuasaan Farmasi JKN Kedah membawa kempen TOBATS, Tolak Ubat Tidak Sah. Angkatan Pertahanan Awam berkongsi ilmu haiwan berbisa dan kesiapsiagaan bencana. Klinik Nurul menjalankan saringan BMI, tekanan darah, glukosa dan PKB40. Persatuan Diabetes mengajar penggunaan glukometer dan penjagaan kaki. Fisioterapi, YAPEIM dan Tabung Haji melengkapkan lingkaran ini dan jangkauannya merentas negeri. Pasukan Nursing Research dari Clinical Research Centre Negeri Sembilan turut bersama dalam Patient Safety Day ini.","words":[{"text":"Tiada","start":0.12,"end":0.36,"type":"word","logprob":-0.004049206754643819},{"text":" ","start":0.36,"end":0.42,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00001966933996300213},{"text":"satu","start":0.42,"end":0.62,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00001966933996300213},{"text":" ","start":0.62,"end":0.7,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00007176141662057489},{"text":"unit","start":0.72,"end":0.9,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00007176141662057489},{"text":" ","start":0.9,"end":0.96,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0001419681793777272},{"text":"pun","start":0.96,"end":1.1,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0001419681793777272},{"text":" ","start":1.1,"end":1.18,"type":"spacing","logprob":-6.437280717364047e-6},{"text":"mampu","start":1.18,"end":1.5,"type":"word","logprob":-6.437280717364047e-6},{"text":" ","start":1.5,"end":1.54,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0008338788175024092},{"text":"melakukannya","start":1.54,"end":2.08,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0008338788175024092},{"text":" ","start":2.08,"end":2.1,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0002616301644593477},{"text":"sendirian.","start":2.1,"end":2.66,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00028843253385275603},{"text":" ","start":2.66,"end":2.66,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.08995324373245239},{"text":"Cawangan","start":3.3,"end":3.68,"type":"word","logprob":-0.03382939094080939},{"text":" ","start":3.68,"end":3.76,"type":"sp